# Requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension or IntelliJ's HTTP client.
# Start the app first:  .\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run

@api = http://localhost:8090/api/orders

### Send an order (key = customer)
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer": "judy", "order": 2016, "item": "usb hub", "amount": 22}

### The messages the @KafkaListener received, newest first
GET {{api}}/received

### Read the topic: partition 0 from offset 0, at most 10 messages
GET {{api}}?partition=0&offset=0&limit=10

### Read all partitions, only alice's orders
GET {{api}}?customer=alice

### Partitions, leaders, replicas, ISR and offsets
GET {{api}}/topic

### An invalid order - 400 with the validation errors
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer": "", "order": 0, "item": "pen", "amount": -5}
